flowchart TB
    GH[GitHub Actions<br/>main only]
    PI[Plan identity<br/>Reader + state access]
    AI[Apply identity<br/>Contributor + state access]
    DI[Deploy identity<br/>Website Contributor]
    GH -->|OIDC| PI
    GH -->|OIDC · protected| AI
    GH -->|OIDC · protected| DI

    PI --> PLAN[Terraform plan]
    PLAN -->|Private plan files<br/>Azure Blob · plans/| BLOB[(Private state container)]
    BLOB -->|Reviewer reads privately| REVIEW[Production approval]
    REVIEW --> APPLY[Apply exact saved plan]
    AI --> APPLY
    DI --> DEPLOY[Deploy source ZIP<br/>Oryx installs requirements]

    subgraph APP[Application resource group]
        direction TB
        W[Azure App Service<br/>Linux · 2+ workers]
        HEALTH[Health Check<br/>traffic isolation]
        HEAL[Auto-Heal<br/>process recycle]
        INSIGHTS[Application Insights]
        LOGS[Log Analytics]
        ALERT[Azure Monitor<br/>HTTP 5xx alert]
        GROUP[Action Group<br/>optional email]
        USERS[Users]
        USERS -->|HTTPS| W
        W -->|/health| HEALTH
        HEALTH -->|Remove unhealthy worker<br/>from routing| W
        W -->|Repeated HTTP 5xx| HEAL
        HEAL -->|Recycle process| W
        W -->|Traces and logs| INSIGHTS
        INSIGHTS --> LOGS
        W -->|Http5xx metric| ALERT
        ALERT --> GROUP
    end

    APPLY -->|Provision resources| W
    DEPLOY --> W
